Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.95,0:00:05.43,TL,,0,0,0,,今年四站大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:07.42,TL,,0,0,0,,菲斯只赢了一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:09.13,TL,,0,0,0,,可今年的年终名单里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:11.51,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次出现了他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:13.05,TL,,0,0,0,,去年法网后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:16.35,TL,,0,0,0,,背伤让他只又打了两场巡回赛单打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:17.92,TL,,0,0,0,,今年又缺席澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.57,TL,,0,0,0,,直到{\fs78}2{\fs68}月才开始新赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:24.80,TL,,0,0,0,,复出第三站 多哈 他一路打到决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:28.55,TL,,0,0,0,,却以{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}输给阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.50,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.76,TL,,0,0,0,,接着是迈阿密 对保罗那场{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.01,TL,,0,0,0,,他救回{\fs78}4{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:38.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘抢七翻了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:58.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:00.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a conclusion!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的结局！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:05.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Arthur Fils is a Miami semi-finalist.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯晋级迈阿密半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:06.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你敢相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:09.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-two down in the breaker.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抢七一度{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:18.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And somehow he's found a way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可他竟然找到了出路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:20.52,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密止步{\fs78}4{\fs68}强之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:23.85,TL,,0,0,0,,他在巴塞罗那两盘击败卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:27.33,TL,,0,0,0,,复出后的第一座奖杯 到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:50.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Arthur Fils conquers Barcelona in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯在巴塞罗那精彩夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:54.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After six months out with a back injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N背伤让他休战{\fs78}6{\fs68}个月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:58.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he stormed back onto the ATP Tour,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他强势重返{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}巡回赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:00.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}playing some of his best tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打出个人顶尖水准
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:03.39,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里 他又进了大师赛{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:04.25,TL,,0,0,0,,复出之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:07.53,TL,,0,0,0,,已经连续在大赛中走到后半程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:10.16,TL,,0,0,0,,可伤病再次打断了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:11.68,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马首战伤退
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:14.28,TL,,0,0,0,,随后因为髋伤退出法网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:17.51,TL,,0,0,0,,两个大满贯 他都没能出场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:21.53,TL,,0,0,0,,温网先赢一轮 第二轮输给贝雷蒂尼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:22.31,TL,,0,0,0,,这一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:25.54,TL,,0,0,0,,也是他今年全部的大满贯胜场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:45.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Matteo Berrettini punches his ticket to round three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝雷蒂尼晋级第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:55.96,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提决赛 他与蒂亚福各拿一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:58.41,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 菲斯送出{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:01.30,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到生涯第一座大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:12.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Arthur Fils.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite scintillating in Cincinnati.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在辛辛那提大放异彩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:24.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is the biggest title of his young career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他年轻生涯分量最重的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:33.74,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 却又在首轮被西西帕斯挡住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:35.22,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:38.45,TL,,0,0,0,,并没有让大满贯的难题自动消失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:43.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Does it in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮收官
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:50.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Stefanos Tsitsipas, through to the second round here of the US Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西西帕斯晋级美网第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A four-set winner over the number ten seed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N四盘击败{\fs78}10{\fs68}号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:59.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that was as good as it gets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这表现无可挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:03.50,TL,,0,0,0,,秋天 东京打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强 上海第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.49,TL,,0,0,0,,布鲁塞尔又进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:08.62,TL,,0,0,0,,一站一站 把积分往上加
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:10.87,TL,,0,0,0,,巴塞尔 面对弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:14.17,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}时 菲斯再次伤退
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.78,TL,,0,0,0,,年终门票还没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:17.92,TL,,0,0,0,,他又没能打完比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:21.42,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}4{\fs68}日 转折来自另一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.89,TL,,0,0,0,,阿利斯击败蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:25.59,TL,,0,0,0,,菲斯的年终资格提前锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.47,TL,,0,0,0,,截至{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.39,TL,,0,0,0,,菲斯{\fs78}3625{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:31.60,TL,,0,0,0,,排在赛季积分榜第七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:35.11,TL,,0,0,0,,高亮的{\fs78}6{\fs68}个人 都已拿到年终门票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:38.64,TL,,0,0,0,,资格到手之后 他又两盘击败马哈奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:40.44,TL,,0,0,0,,继续巴黎的征程
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:42.21,TL,,0,0,0,,法国男网时隔{\fs78}10{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.59,TL,,0,0,0,,终于又有人入围年终
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:57.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Arthur Fils caps off what has been a fabulous French day.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯为法国球员的精彩一天收官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:02.07,TL,,0,0,0,,大满贯只有一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.50,TL,,0,0,0,,却拼出了第一张年终门票
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:05.78,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次到都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:08.46,TL,,0,0,0,,你看好菲斯拿下几场胜利？
